提示#Notice:|
对于超模内容,游戏会自动计算合理价格.\r如果未使用任何超模数据,数据菜单栏将会显示图标方便您进行炫耀数据.#The game automatically calculates balanced prices for overpowered content.\rIf your save contains no overpowered data/com an icon will appear in the stats menu so you can show off your progress.:|
发送诊断数据:\r发送游戏存档, 包括饱腹,状态等各种游戏内数据. 可能会包括该游戏内存和CPU使用情况#Send diagnostic data:\rSend your game save/com including satiety/com status/com and other in-game data. This may also include the game's memory and CPU usage.:|
不发送诊断数据:\r适用于启用修改器,修改过游戏数据等不符合分析数据条件. 或不希望提供游戏数据的玩家#Do not send diagnostic data:\rFor players using trainers or modified game data that is unsuitable for analysis/com or who prefer not to share game data.:|
